From d3a332320d339e16de9515179ae54bebd5aa57b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Jelen <jjelen@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:35:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Update the upstream signing key

Replace libguestfs.keyring with rich@annexia.org-pubkey.txt, the key
upstream publishes at
https://download.libguestfs.org/rich@annexia.org-pubkey.txt (byte for
byte); its Source line is now that URL.

The current key is needed to verify the release signature with
openpgpverify (sqv), which checks that the key was valid when the
release was signed.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 libguestfs.keyring          | Bin 2823 -> 0 bytes
 rich@annexia.org-pubkey.txt |  65 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 virt-p2v.spec               |   2 +-
 3 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 delete mode 100644 libguestfs.keyring
 create mode 100644 rich@annexia.org-pubkey.txt

